You can trust
Ollama's cloud [https://ollama.com/pricing] to power your =
projects, tools, and integrations. There are no surprise fees or banning
your favorite integrations.


https://ollama.com/pricing


Set up OpenClaw

Open a terminal, and type in:
=C2=A0
ollama launch openclaw
=C2=A0
By default, Ollama will also configure openclaw to use its web search =
functionality.
=C2=A0
If you want to customize your OpenClaw after to =
connect different chat apps or other integrations, please run:
=C2=A0
openclaw onboard
=C2=A0


